<title>UK: Nat'l Express wins central train franchise.</title>
<headline>Nat'l Express wins central train franchise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British transport company National Express Group Plc Group Plc said on Monday that it had been awarded a seven year and one month franchise for the Central trains.</p>
<p>National Express said it would receive an average annual franchise subsidy of 152.9 million stg over the life of the franchise.</p>
</text>
